1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,629
Aplikasi di HP Android kamu...

2
00:00:02,629 --> 00:00:05,889
ternyata banyak yang
ditulis pakai "bahasa Jawa"!

3
00:00:05,889 --> 00:00:07,125
Namanya Java,

4
00:00:07,125 --> 00:00:09,435
bahasa pemrograman terkenal dunia...

5
00:00:09,435 --> 00:00:11,251
dan namanya bukan kebetulan.

6
00:00:11,251 --> 00:00:13,041
Nama awalnya "Oak"...

7
00:00:13,041 --> 00:00:14,654
tapi ditolak pengacara,

8
00:00:14,654 --> 00:00:16,477
karena sudah dipakai perusahaan lain.

9
00:00:16,477 --> 00:00:17,692
Sambil ngopi,

10
00:00:17,692 --> 00:00:19,017
timnya memilih "Java",

11
00:00:19,017 --> 00:00:21,261
