12
00:00:21,261 --> 00:00:22,355
dari Pulau Jawa!

13
00:00:22,355 --> 00:00:23,738
Bahkan Minecraft,

14
00:00:23,738 --> 00:00:25,531
game terlaris sepanjang masa,

15
00:00:25,531 --> 00:00:27,204
